Undeflected: qE = qvB \Rightarrow v = E/B = 2.0 \times 10^{7}\ \mathrm{m\,s^{-1}}
qvB = \dfrac{mv^2}{r} \Rightarrow \dfrac{q}{m} = \dfrac{v}{Br}
\dfrac{q}{m} = \dfrac{2.0 \times 10^{7}}{(1.0 \times 10^{-3})(0.114)} = 1.8 \times 10^{11}\ \mathrm{C\,kg^{-1}}

